{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"resistanceDistance","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"source","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"target","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tolerance","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = 1e-10, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols13NoConvergenceV","text":"NoConvergence","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/NoConvergence"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Conjugate gradients on the Laplacian grounded at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"target"},{"type":"text","text":", from 0, until the residual’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Euclidean norm is at most "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tolerance"},{"type":"text","text":" (relative to the right-hand side, which has norm 1),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or, on a weight spread that puts that below rounding, until the true residual stops"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"improving. Jacobi preconditioned for 300 iterations, then by a modified incomplete Cholesky"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"factor in maximum-spanning-tree order. O((n + m) √κ) time; about 9 n words, and O(n + m) for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the factor when it is built."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","name":"Precondition","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"source"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"target"},{"type":"text","text":" are vertices of the graph, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tolerance > 0"},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations"},{"type":"text","text":", when given, is at least 1."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"},{"type":"aside","name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NoConvergence"},{"type":"text","text":" after "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxIterations"},{"type":"text","text":" conjugate-gradient iterations (one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"matrix–vector product each; 20,000 + 2n when nil), with that count and the residual’s norm"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"relative to the right-hand side’s. No input has reached the default limit in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"measurements."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SpectralGraphTheory\/documentation\/SpectralGraphTheory","doc:\/\/SpectralGraphTheory\/documentation\/SpectralGraphTheory\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/SpectralGraphTheory\/documentation\/SpectralGraphTheory\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/spectralgraphtheory\/graphprotocols\/graph\/resistancedistance(from:to:tolerance:maxiterations:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"resistanceDistance(from:to:tolerance:maxIterations:)","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P08SpectralA6TheoryE18resistanceDistance4from2to9tolerance13maxIterationsSdSg6VertexQz_ALSdSiSgtAA13NoConvergenceVYKF","remoteSource":{"fileName":"ElectricalNetworks.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/SpectralGraphTheory\/ElectricalNetworks.swift#L89"},"extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"resistanceDistance"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tolerance"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"maxIterations"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) "},{"kind":"keyword","te